## Definition lists — a documented gap

The AST has a `definition_list` node, but **there is no markdown syntax that
produces it** — it can only be constructed programmatically. So a `term: def`
written here is just a paragraph. This is exactly the kind of edge case this page
exists to surface. :bulb:
